            "created_at": "2025-08-09T01:36:01.518771+00:00",
            "notes": "For round one, the clear first choice to support this build is [Iceberg](item_312193a7-1f88-462f-93fe-9a60f4462d47). This power is the crux of the build, and the other powers we will take aren't nearly as effective without it. For example, if you take  [Snowball Flight](item_770c6b61-98a8-489f-b44e-c1cc65c0cd7d) first, you will generate less money (already an issue with the build) and your single large ice pillars will be much less impactful without the mini blizzards.\n\nI take [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) and [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) to help generate a little more money in the early rounds. For your third item, I suggest something to help you live longer, usually [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) or  [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318).\n\nAbility damage is not useful yet, and you want to try and live as long as possible in the first few rounds. Play slow and with your team, trying to split off enemies or block their cooldowns with every wall \u2013 you will only get one wall every 10 seconds, so try not to waste them. Dying is the main reason you will miss out on money, so try to extend team fights and be as annoying as possible without dying!\n\n\nTip: Increasing both weapon power and attack speed increases your DPS multiplicatively! It's a good idea to have some of both of these stats with beam weapons for this reason.",
