            "created_at": "2025-08-09T01:36:01.518771+00:00",
            "notes": "In round four we take either [Sturdy Snowfort](item_afbba267-dff5-4018-a8ab-fa743d128d6b) or [Icy Veins](item_2c403951-4f9b-4390-ad1e-aabaa09a6da5) \u2013 whichever one we didn't take in round three. Having both of these will start to make your walls a major source of damage, so sell some of the blues to afford this combo if you need. This is the point where ability power can be more helpful than weapon power, but a mix of both is good for this build.\n\nIf you have a little extra money, or are finding it difficult to close kills you can also try  [Himalayan Hat](item_b567acb7-baa2-4085-a610-d6a19d16fb0c) \u2013 you will get a constant 15% attack speed, but 25% at the most important times.\n\nThis round is the time to be even more annoying! This is usually where I can start getting tons of cheeky final blows and dominate the kill feed.\n\nIf you're having trouble staying alive, [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) synergizes amazingly with [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016). Also check out [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643), the lifesteal can be a huge help.",
