            "notes": "Round five is where this build really soars! You have a choice to make here, and either option is a huge power spike. If you are dying a lot, or the enemy has a large damage output (like a Reaper, or missile based D.Va builds), take [Twice as Ice](item_f2bf9a0f-1a59-406a-bf9f-3b9c2abc2a84). This recently got buffed to also include [Snowball Flight](item_770c6b61-98a8-489f-b44e-c1cc65c0cd7d) so you will literally double your wall output with this power. \n\nIf you are having issues securing kills, or find that the enemy lets you wall them off a lot, take [Cold Blaster](item_70947297-40d0-4b60-a679-fd3bbf1e214e). You will absolutely delete enemies caught in your walls with this power.\n\nWith either choice you take here, [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) is a very good pickup at this point. At this point you should be able to afford this as well as both [Icy Veins](item_2c403951-4f9b-4390-ad1e-aabaa09a6da5) and [Sturdy Snowfort](item_afbba267-dff5-4018-a8ab-fa743d128d6b). With all three of these items your walls become extremely dangerous and cannot be ignored.\n\nIf you took [Twice as Ice](item_f2bf9a0f-1a59-406a-bf9f-3b9c2abc2a84), you can throw walls out practically constantly, and it becomes very easy to split apart enemy teams. You can make team fights an absolute nightmare for your enemy to navigate. Be careful though, because this many walls can also start to be an issue for your team too. Make sure you aren't blocking your tank from your healers, or blocking crucial cooldowns for your team. Like I said in the build notes, you need to play intelligently and manage your cooldowns well, even with the immense number of ice pillars you can produce.\n\nI also recommend trying [Three-tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429), especially if you took [Twice as Ice](item_f2bf9a0f-1a59-406a-bf9f-3b9c2abc2a84). Those first three instances happen basically instantly if you use your primary fire, giving you a decent damage spike.",
