        {
            "id": "4a3ccc3b-ea4a-4cc6-9e80-a80b164a28bd",
            "build_id": "154659ba-f892-47bf-bece-8c489bd5dbf7",
            "round_number": 7,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-08-09T01:36:01.518771+00:00",
            "notes": "If you get to round seven, again take either [Twice as Ice](item_f2bf9a0f-1a59-406a-bf9f-3b9c2abc2a84) or [Cold Blaster](item_70947297-40d0-4b60-a679-fd3bbf1e214e), whichever you didn't take in round five. \n\nHonestly stay with your team a lot more in round seven \u2013 I basically stop flanking here. Even though your build is complete and you can be a menace, so is everyone else's. Your enemies will be super strong here, so you still need to be smart about wall usage and trying to stay alive.\n\nIf you need extra survivability, [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) is pretty good here if you still have [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016), because you'll have a lot of cooldowns. \n\nFor extra damage output, go with [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce). Weapon power items like [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce) or [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) can also be quite good.\n\nThe only items that I think are mandatory at this point are [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505), [Icy Veins](item_2c403951-4f9b-4390-ad1e-aabaa09a6da5), and [Sturdy Snowfort](item_afbba267-dff5-4018-a8ab-fa743d128d6b). Everything else is up to you and how you want to adapt to your enemies.",
